{
  "id": "RAW_5355dee45d",
  "title": "Codex 额度用完之后，如何用 OpenViking 接着把活干完",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247523063&idx=2&sn=bb1142c4825757cfa1032af451b2b242",
  "date": "2026-10-09 19:00:00",
  "author": "字节跳动技术团队",
  "siteName": "字节跳动技术团队",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>OpenViking</span> <span>2026-10-09 19:00</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_a265502.jpeg\"></p>\n  <div style=\"font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">一、OpenViking 在 Agent 上下文中的价值</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">当用户同时使用多个 Coding Agent 时，真正影响协作体验的，往往不是单个模型够不够强，而是</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">上下文能不能跟着任务一起流动</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。现实里，用户在 Codex、Trae、Claude Code、豆包等不同 Agent 之间切换，往往不是因为项目结束了，而是因为额度、环境、合规、工具适配或阶段分工发生了变化。</span></p>\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">问题在于，传统的上下文大多只存在于会话窗口里。需求背景、技术判断、已试过的方案、排查结论、剩余待办，都散落在历史对话中。一旦切到另一个 Agent，新的 Agent 往往只看到一段简短说明，或者依赖用户手动复制粘贴，于是重复理解、重复分析、重复试错，项目推进被迫中断或者效果受到影响。</span></p>\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenViking 解决的正是这个问题，</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenViking 是面向 AI Agent 的统一上下文数据库</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。 它是位于不同 Agent 背后的共享 Context 层。豆包、Traecode 、Codex 等都可以接到同一个 OpenViking 上读写，即使 Agent 工具换了，上下文也可以一直延续。</span></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039404\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_a87d3f8.jpeg\"></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">它把 Agent 工作所需的信息拆成三层，统一组织成可检索、可分层加载的上下文系统。产品文档中将这三层定义为&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Resource（知识依据层）、Memory（动态认知层）、Skill（标准能力层）</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，分别回答“事实和依据在哪里”“过去学到了什么”“这件事应该怎么做”。</span></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.562963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039405\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_b56d0df.png\"></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2157407\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039401\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_b871a57.png\"></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">更关键的是，OpenViking 面对一个新任务，Agent 不需要把所有历史材料一次性塞进上下文，而是按需分层加载：先读&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">L0 摘要</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">判断哪些目录相关，再看&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">L1 概览</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">了解关键背景和当前状态，只有核对细节时才加载&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">L2 完整内容</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。任务结束后，Session Commit 会从这次对话和执行过程中提取值得长期保留的偏好、方法和经验，自动写回 Memory。</span></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">二、结合小 V 跨 Agent 场景，OpenViking 具体能做什么</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">拿一个更贴近真实工作的案例来理解。小 V 是前端开发，正在做一个 OpenViking 官网 Demo。这个项目不是一次性在同一个 Agent 里完成的，而是会随着阶段变化切换不同 Agent。</span></p>\n      <ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">前期探索阶段：</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">小 V 先在豆包里梳理需求、补 PRD、拆模块、确认页面结构。</span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">原型开发阶段：</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">再到 Codex 或 Claude Code 里快速生成官网 Demo，补首页结构、核心模块和页面代码。</span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">正式推进阶段：</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">如果 Codex 额度不够，或者需要回到公司环境继续开发，就切到 Trae 接着完成后半程。</span></p>\n       </li>\n      </ol>\n      <ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" start=\"3\"></ol>\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">过去这个切换过程最麻烦的地方在于：前一个 Agent 做过的事情，很难原封不动地传给下一个 Agent。OpenViking 在这里承担的是一个</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">项目上下文中枢</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">的角色，让不同阶段形成的材料分门别类地沉淀下来，后续 Agent 不需要重开一局，而是直接接着做。</span></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">1、前一个 Agent 产出的内容，如何沉淀进 OpenViking</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在这个案例里，小 V 在豆包和 Codex 中推进项目时，产生的内容不会只停留在聊天记录中，而是会持续写入 OpenViking。关键点是：这些内容不是平铺存储，而是按目录归档。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.8222222\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039402\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_14bea07.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;color: rgb(144, 139, 139);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><sub style=\"font-size: 11px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在豆包工作中将核心项目资料同步到 OpenViking 中</span></sub></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.8509259\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039403\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_22d005f.png\"></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 11px;color: rgb(144, 139, 139);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在 Codex 中通过 OpenViking 读取项目资料，无需重复输入直接开发</span></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">小 V 在豆包里完成的需求补充、PRD 说明和模块拆解，可以作为稳定材料写进&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Resource</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">；在 Codex 中逐渐明确的交互偏好、页面取舍、技术约束和待办事项，则更适合沉淀到&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Memory</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。这样一来，下一个 Agent 接手时，不需要从零推断“哪些是背景、哪些是结论、哪些是接下来要做的事”，而是可以按目录读取对应信息。</span></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">2、当 Codex 额度不够时，为什么可以“一键平移上下文”</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">当小 V 在 Codex 中把官网 Demo 做到一半，遇到额度不足、环境限制，或者想切到 Trae 继续在公司环境里开发时，过去最常见的做法是：人工写一段 handoff 说明，把需求、进度和代码片段复制过去。但这种方式既容易丢信息，也会让后一个 Agent 重复理解。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0% 8px;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;width: 100%;border-left: 3px solid rgb(219, 219, 219);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 8px;align-self: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenViking 的价值，不是替用户保存一段聊天记录，而是把这段聊天里真正值得保留的项目材料，沉淀成后续 Agent 可以直接消费的上下文资产。</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在这个案例里，Trae 接手时可以直接做三件事：</span></p>\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">先读&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Resource</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：理解 OpenViking 官网要表达的产品价值、页面结构和内容素材；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">再读&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Memory</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：看到小 V 之前已经确认了哪些设计决策、做到了什么阶段、还有哪些待办；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最后按&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Skill</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">：沿着既有工作流继续 coding，而不是重新规划一遍。</span></p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.45053\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"566\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039408\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_e65e3d8.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 11px;color: rgb(144, 139, 139);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在 Trae 中通过 OpenViking 读取项目资料，Codex 历史开发代码，原型图继续开发</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">所以，对小 V 这样的真实开发场景来说，OpenViking 解决的痛点并不是“我能不能多存一点信息”，而是“我能不能把前一个 Agent 的工作真正交给下一个 Agent 接着做”。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">三、快速上手：三步让 Agent 带着同一套上下文持续工作</span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">让你的agent 能够带着同一套上下文持续工作，只需完成下面三步：</span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一步，开通并创建库</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">进入 OpenViking 官网首页，点击立即开通</span></p>\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">（<a href=\"https://www.volcengine.com/product/OpenViking-service），有企业版和个人版本，按需选择即可；\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.volcengine.com/product/OpenViking-service），有企业版和个人版本，按需选择即可；</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ol>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5648148\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039406\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_b8a9c74.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" start=\"2\">\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">进入控制台（<a href=\"https://s.c1ns.cn/uQNo2）后创建库，填写名称、描述和版本，再添加至少一处模型凭证：\" target=\"_blank\">https://s.c1ns.cn/uQNo2）后创建库，填写名称、描述和版本，再添加至少一处模型凭证：</a> Agent Plan、Coding Plan 或推理接入点</span><span style=\"color: rgb(122, 112, 112);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">（AgentPlan官网：<a href=\"https://console.volcengine.com/ark/region:cn-beijing/subscription/Agent-plan?projectName=default，配置模型后获取专属\" target=\"_blank\">https://console.volcengine.com/ark/region:cn-beijing/subscription/Agent-plan?projectName=default，配置模型后获取专属</a> Base URL 和 API Key)</span></span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ol>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5527778\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039407\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_5c4023c.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 11px;color: rgb(144, 139, 139);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">开通并创建库</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第二步：接入 Agent</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在控制台进入接入 Agent页面，OpenViking 目前已适配了主流 Agent：选择对应agent页面后，点击</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">“复制为 Markdown”</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，把复制到的完整内容发给 Agent ,即可自动执行安装步骤。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.8314815\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039410\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_a634128.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">以 Codex 为例，先进入到OpenViking Context 控制台 → 点击接入 Agent → 选择Codex &nbsp;→ 点击复制为Markdown → 直接粘贴到 Codex 后运行，即可完成接入。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.1391863\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"934\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039409\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_e149b11.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 11px;color: rgb(144, 139, 139);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">进入 Codex 接入页，点击复制为 Markdown</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.9212963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039414\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_99c44b0.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;font-size: 11px;color: rgb(144, 139, 139);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">粘贴到 Codex 完成安装</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在「设置 → MCP → 已配置的 MCP Servers」中确认能够看到&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(30, 107, 184);background-color: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenViking</span></span><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;条目即表示接入成功。</span></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4518519\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039411\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_a957f04.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: unset;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第三步：配置个性化规则（可选）</span></span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果希望 Agent 在后续对话中稳定遵守“写入前确认、结束自动提交”等规则，可以把长期记忆库的读写规则粘贴到 Agent 的个性化指令中。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">以 Codex 为例，打开“启用个性化”，复制下方整段文案，粘贴到“自定义指令”并保存。只需设置一次，之后的新对话都会生，以下是示例，可以按需微调，比如指定写入的范围，自动写入还是指令触发，都可以自定义设置。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p class=\"code-snippet__fix code-snippet__js\"></p>\n   <ul class=\"code-snippet__line-index code-snippet__js\"></ul>\n   <pre class=\"code-snippet__js\" data-lang=\"sql\"><code><span leaf=\"\">在每轮对话中，判断当前任务是否需要使用历史记忆、个人偏好、既有规范、上下文或复盘经验。需要时，优先通过 OpenViking&nbsp;<span class=\"code-snippet__keyword\">search</span>&nbsp;召回相关记忆，并将其作为分析、生成、修改、决策和执行的默认依据。</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">执行任务前，主动检索并遵循已沉淀的稳定要求，包括表达与交付风格、格式规范、工作流程、质量标准、目标对象、平台限制、常用方式及禁用项，避免重复询问已有信息。</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">多轮协作中，识别可跨任务复用的偏好、规则和经验。仅将长期稳定、经过验证的规律，通过 OpenViking remember 提炼并存入 memories；不记录仅适用于单次任务的主题、案例、数据或临时要求。</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">持续沉淀：</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">用户认可或否定的方案、表达和交付方式</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">已验证有效的策略、流程、模板和判断标准</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">重要信息更新及可复用的行动线索</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">执行结果、反馈数据及其优化结论</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">跨任务可复用的方法、规范和协作经验</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">若本轮明确要求与历史记忆冲突，以本轮要求为准；确认属于长期调整后，再更新对应记忆。</span></code><br></pre>\n   <p></p>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最后，一句话总结</span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenViking 可以让你的 Agent 在不同工具、不同阶段、不同额度条件下，依然能沿着同一套上下文持续工作。对于小 V 这样的跨 Agent 开发场景来说，它解决的是最实际的痛点：</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">前一个 Agent 做到一半，后一个 Agent 能不能真正接着干，提高效率的同时节约token，打工人的福音！</span></span></strong></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;padding: 24px;background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249);border-radius: 10px;overflow: hidden;box-shadow: rgb(255, 255, 250) 1px 1px 5px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">🚀&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">上手试用，前 50 文档免费：</span></span></strong></p>\n      <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">volcengine.com/product/openviking-service</span></p>\n      <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">🌟</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;开</span></span></strong><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">源 OpenViking：</span></span></strong></p>\n      <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">访问&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">GitHub 仓库</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(122, 112, 112);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">（<a href=\"https://github.com/volcengine/OpenViking）\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/volcengine/OpenViking）</a></span></span><span leaf=\"\">，为我们点亮一颗 Star！</span></p>\n      <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">❓三分钟测出你</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">是哪种&nbsp;</span></span><span leaf=\"\">Agent 饲养员选择属于你的 OpenViking</span></p>\n      <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">https</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">://blog.openviking.ai/post/should-you-use-openviking/</span></span></p>\n      <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">💬 加入飞书交流群&amp;微信群！</span></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"margin: 10px 0%;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 50%;padding: 0px 5px 0px 0px;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0%;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 85%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.3833866\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"939\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039413\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_a1a9d01.png\"></p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 50%;padding: 0px 0px 0px 5px;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0%;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.1674141\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"669\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100039412\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261009124323_3844037.png\"></p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p class=\"mp_profile_iframe_wrp\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-profile class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card mp_profile_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"mpprofile\" data-nickname=\"字节跳动技术团队\" data-headimg=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/5EcwYhllQOhkoWTP1gVm0Lqs480XOARyoSYjPEsRVCSF35cbWIp6cliaYic8KUfNfiaSjVnruzTQUTCA0lmv9vUmw/0?wx_fmt=png\" data-signature=\"字节跳动的技术实践分享\" data-id=\"MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==\"></mp-common-profile></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "OpenViking 作为统一上下文数据库，让不同 Agent 共享项目记忆，确保在 Codex 额度耗尽后，Trae 或其他 Agent 能无缝接续开发，避免重复理解和工作中断。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "OpenViking 作为统一上下文数据库，让不同 Agent 共享项目记忆，确保在 Codex 额度耗尽后，Trae 或其他 Agent 能无缝接续开发，避免重复理解和工作中断。",
  "summary": "文章介绍 OpenViking 如何解决跨 Agent 协作中的上下文流动问题。当用户因额度、环境或分工切换 Agent 时，OpenViking 存储并组织历史对话、技术判断、待办事项等信息，使新 Agent 能快速理解项目状态，继续执行任务，提高效率并节约 token。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "OpenViking 解决跨 Agent 上下文流动问题",
      "explanation": "在多 Agent 协作中，上下文通常只存在于单个会话窗口。OpenViking 作为共享数据库，让不同 Agent 都能读取和更新同一套项目记忆，确保切换时信息不丢失，工作能持续推进。"
    },
    {
      "point": "三层结构组织项目信息",
      "explanation": "OpenViking 将信息分为 Resource（知识依据）、Memory（动态认知）和 Skill（标准能力）。这种分层让 Agent 能按需加载上下文，避免一次性塞入过多无关信息，提高检索效率。"
    },
    {
      "point": "实际开发场景中的应用",
      "explanation": "以小 V 开发 OpenViking 官网为例，说明如何将豆包、Codex 和 Trae 的工作成果分别沉淀到 OpenViking，实现无缝切换。当 Codex 额度用完，Trae 可直接读取之前的设计决策和待办事项，继续开发。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "OpenViking 是面向 AI Agent 的统一上下文数据库。它是位于不同 Agent 背后的共享 Context 层。",
    "问题在于，传统的上下文大多只存在于会话窗口里。需求背景、技术判断、已试过的方案、排查结论、剩余待办，都散落在历史对话中。",
